## Why This Is Asked

End-to-end visibility across services helps beginners diagnose where causality breaks in CNPA pipelines, a common production issue after deployments.

## Key Concepts

- Distributed tracing across HTTP, DB, and messaging layers
- Trace propagation (W3C traceparent) and context maintenance
- Sampling strategies and exporters (OpenTelemetry, Jaeger/OTLP)
- End-to-end verification with test injections and trace reconciliation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example using OpenTelemetry in Node.js
const { trace } = require('@opentelemetry/api');
const tracer = trace.getTracer('cnpa-api');
async function handle(req, res){
  const span = tracer.startSpan('http_handler');
  // perform DB insert and Kafka publish here
  span.end();
  res.end('ok');
}
```

